#ASSERT `the Home definition's exclusions (c) to (g) apply to` (`The insured premises` WITH `the kind of building` IS `a house`, `at the address in the Policy Summary` IS TRUE, `the Insured's principal personal residence` IS TRUE, `used wholly or mainly as the Insured's private residence` IS TRUE, `part used as an office` IS FALSE, `office use approved by the authorities` IS FALSE, `used for a trade or business other than an office` IS FALSE, `walls of concrete, brick or stone` IS TRUE, `roof of concrete, tiles, slate or incombustible metal sheet` IS TRUE, `under construction` IS FALSE, `being demolished or vacant pending demolition` IS FALSE, `a temporary building or structure` IS TRUE, `enclosed by walls or fences` IS TRUE, `some part is lent, let or sublet` IS FALSE, `some part is used to manufacture, deposit or store goods` IS FALSE)
