§§ `Contents (src:111-159), fork F-contents-j`

GIVEN property IS A LIST OF `A description of property`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Contents:` property MEANS `the property is Contents` (`a loss to` `the Contents` `of` property `by` `fire` `with` EMPTY)

#ASSERT `Contents:` (LIST `furniture, a refrigerator, washing machine or similar household good`)
#ASSERT `Contents:` (LIST `audio-visual equipment`)
#ASSERT `Contents:` (LIST `a musical instrument`)
#ASSERT `Contents:` (LIST `a TV or radio antenna, antenna fitting or mast, or a satellite dish`)
#ASSERT `Contents:` (LIST `a golf buggy, garden appliance or motorised wheelchair`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `a golf buggy, garden appliance or motorised wheelchair`, `required to be registered`)
#ASSERT `Contents:` (LIST `office furniture or equipment used for the Insured's own business in the Home`)
#ASSERT `Contents:` (LIST `tools or equipment used to earn income`)
-- Not listed in (a)-(e): not Contents.
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `a boiler, economiser or other pressure vessel or apparatus, or its contents`)
-- Exclusions (a)-(l), each against an item (a)-(e) would otherwise admit.
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `furniture, a refrigerator, washing machine or similar household good`, `a fish, bird or other animal`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `furniture, a refrigerator, washing machine or similar household good`, `trees, shrubs, grass or other living plants`)
#ASSERT `Contents:` (LIST `furniture, a refrigerator, washing machine or similar household good`, `trees, shrubs, grass or other living plants`, `a pot plant`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `a golf buggy, garden appliance or motorised wheelchair`, `a motor vehicle licensed for road use, a caravan or a trailer`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `tools or equipment used to earn income`, `a watercraft`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `photographic, video or sports equipment`, `an aircraft or aircraft accessory`)
#ASSERT `Contents:` (LIST `photographic, video or sports equipment`, `an aircraft or aircraft accessory`, `an aircraft that cannot be piloted`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `tools or equipment used to earn income`, `a part, key, lock or alarm of a vehicle, caravan, trailer, aircraft or watercraft`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `audio-visual equipment`, `held unlawfully by the Insured`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `tools or equipment used to earn income`, `equipment for developing or producing an illegal substance`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `personal effects, normally carried or worn on the person`, `cash or coins`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `personal effects, normally carried or worn on the person`, `a negotiable instrument`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `personal effects, normally carried or worn on the person`, `jewellery, gold, silver or other precious metal, or a precious stone`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `furniture, a refrigerator, washing machine or similar household good`, `an antique or an item of special value`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `audio-visual equipment`, `a laptop computer, mobile phone or camera`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `office furniture or equipment used for the Insured's own business in the Home`, `business or retail stock`)
-- F-contents-j: a treadmill (sports equipment that stays at home) is Contents; the same
-- equipment normally carried away is not.
#ASSERT `Contents:` (LIST `photographic, video or sports equipment`)
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `photographic, video or sports equipment`, `an item normally carried away from the Insured Location`)
-- (l): the Home or any part of it.
#ASSERT NOT `Contents:` (LIST `furniture, a refrigerator, washing machine or similar household good`, `the house or apartment itself`)

-- Whose property, and where it was.
GIVEN owner IS AN `An owner of property`
      place IS A `A place where property was`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a sofa is Contents, owned by` owner `at` place MEANS
    `the property is Contents`
        (`a loss to` `the Contents` `of` (LIST `furniture, a refrigerator, washing machine or similar household good`) `owned by` owner `at` place
             `on` (YMD 2026 3 10) `by` `fire` `with` EMPTY `, unattended for` 0 `days`)

#ASSERT `a sofa is Contents, owned by` `the Insured` `at` `inside a lockable part of the Home`
#ASSERT `a sofa is Contents, owned by` (`a relative of the Insured` `a spouse` TRUE) `at` `inside a lockable part of the Home`
#ASSERT NOT `a sofa is Contents, owned by` (`a relative of the Insured` `a spouse` FALSE) `at` `inside a lockable part of the Home`
#ASSERT `a sofa is Contents, owned by` `another person, for whose loss the Insured or Family is legally responsible` `at` `inside a lockable part of the Home`
#ASSERT NOT `a sofa is Contents, owned by` `a domestic helper` `at` `inside a lockable part of the Home`
#ASSERT NOT `a sofa is Contents, owned by` `another person` `at` `inside a lockable part of the Home`
#ASSERT `a sofa is Contents, owned by` `the Insured` `at` `outdoors at the Insured Location`
#ASSERT NOT `a sofa is Contents, owned by` `the Insured` `at` `away from the Insured Location`
#ASSERT NOT `a sofa is Contents, owned by` `the Insured` `at` `in transit`

-- F-family: a spouse who does not live at the Insured Location is not Family on reading (i);
-- on reading (ii), not taken, the spouse would be.
#ASSERT NOT `a relative is in the Insured's Family, being` `a spouse` `, living with the Insured` FALSE
#ASSERT `on reading (ii), a relative is in the Insured's Family, being` `a spouse` `, living with the Insured` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `on reading (ii), a relative is in the Insured's Family, being` `another relative` `, living with the Insured` FALSE

§§ `Peril 1: fire (src:166-173)`

#ASSERT `the peril ground` `Peril 1(a): fermentation, natural heating or spontaneous combustion` `defeats` (`a house fire with` `fermentation, natural heating or spontaneous combustion`)
#ASSERT `the peril ground` `Peril 1(b): a process involving heat` `defeats` (`a house fire with` `the property underwent a process involving heat`)
#ASSERT `the peril ground` `Peril 1(c): burning by order of a public authority` `defeats` (`a house fire with` `burning by order of a public authority`)
#ASSERT `the peril ground` `Peril 1(d): forest, bush or grass fire, or clearing land by fire` `defeats` (`a house fire with` `forest, bush, grass or jungle fire, or clearing land by fire`)
#ASSERT `the peril ground` `Peril 1(e): scorching, melting or charring without flame` `defeats` (`a house fire with` `scorching, melting or charring without flame`)
-- Near misses: the fire exclusions bite only within Peril 1; an explosion with the same
-- circumstance is not defeated by them.
#ASSERT `covered:` (`the house damaged by` `explosion` `with` (LIST `fermentation, natural heating or spontaneous combustion`))
#ASSERT `covered:` (`the house damaged by` `explosion` `with` (LIST `scorching, melting or charring without flame`))
#ASSERT NOT `the peril ground` `Peril 1(c): burning by order of a public authority` `defeats` (`the house damaged by` `lightning` `with` (LIST `burning by order of a public authority`))

§§ `Peril 2: explosion (src:174-176)`

#ASSERT `the peril ground` `Peril 2: a boiler or other pressure vessel or apparatus, or its contents` `defeats` (`a loss to` `the Home` `of` (LIST `the house or apartment itself`, `a boiler, economiser or other pressure vessel or apparatus, or its contents`) `by` `explosion` `with` EMPTY)
#ASSERT NOT `the peril ground` `Peril 2: a boiler or other pressure vessel or apparatus, or its contents` `defeats` (`a loss to` `the Home` `of` (LIST `the house or apartment itself`, `a boiler, economiser or other pressure vessel or apparatus, or its contents`) `by` `fire` `with` EMPTY)

§§ `Peril 3: lightning (src:177-178)`

