#ASSERT `covered:` (`the house damaged by` `riot or civil disturbance` `with` EMPTY)
#ASSERT `covered:` (`the house damaged by` `lawful authority suppressing a disturbance` `with` EMPTY)
#ASSERT `covered:` (`the house damaged by` `wilful act of a striker or locked-out worker` `with` EMPTY)
#ASSERT `covered:` (`the house damaged by` `lawful authority suppressing a striker's act` `with` EMPTY)
#ASSERT `covered:` (`the house damaged by` `malicious act of any person` `with` EMPTY)
